{"title":"대영반","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=cd6PCc/hAC1NfIKBM/gw2WM1FTqwKJQFxzu2RJJ1&filename=th3","synopsis":"“멈추시오, 대영반!”  \n황제의 스승이자 백만금 군을 양성한 무학의 대종사, 그에겐 고금 제일을 내려놓더라도 가야 할 길이 있었다.  \n\n바람을 맞으며 걸었다. 더 이상 늙수그레한 외모와 새하얀 백발은 온데간데없었다.  \n칠흑의 머리카락을 휘날리는 청년만이 있을 뿐!  \n“이궐이라 하오.”  \n\n얽매이지 않을 것이다. 바람처럼 천하를 누비리라. 그윽한 다향이 핏빛 강호를 정화한다.  \n불좌의 주인. 대영반 이궐의 행보에 주목하라!","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":129,"change":{"type":"up","amount":8}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":123,"change":{"type":"up","amount":6}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":120,"change":{"type":"up","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":100,"change":{"type":"up","amount":20}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":128,"change":{"type":"down","amount":28}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":116,"change":{"type":"up","amount":12}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":111,"change":{"type":"up","amount":5}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":114,"change":{"type":"down","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":95,"change":{"type":"up","amount":19}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":91,"change":{"type":"up","amount":4}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":113,"change":{"type":"down","amount":22}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":117,"change":{"type":"down","amount":4}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":100,"change":{"type":"up","amount":17}},{"date":"2026-08-22","rank":103,"change":{"type":"down","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-08-23","rank":110,"change":{"type":"down","amount":7}},{"date":"2026-08-24","rank":120,"change":{"type":"down","amount":10}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":141,"change":{"type":"down","amount":21}},{"date":"2026-08-26","rank":145,"change":{"type":"down","amount":4}},{"date":"2026-08-27","rank":143,"change":null},{"date":"2026-08-28","rank":104,"change":{"type":"up","amount":39}},{"date":"2026-08-29","rank":125,"change":{"type":"down","amount":21}},{"date":"2026-08-31","rank":159,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-01","rank":141,"change":{"type":"up"